Facto-DSA implementation package

Reference_Implementation contains one the Reference Implementation version in one ISO C implementation folder per required NGCC strength level:
  Facto-DSA-128
  Facto-DSA-256
  Facto-DSA-512

(Performance) Optimization_Implementation contains the Performance Optimization version in one ISO C implementation folder per required NGCC strength level:
  Facto-DSA-128
  Facto-DSA-256
  Facto-DSA-512

  Resource_Optimization Implementation contains the Resource Optimization version in one ISO C implementation folder per required NGCC strength level:
  Facto-DSA-128
  Facto-DSA-256
  Facto-DSA-512

Both reference, performance and resource optimized implementation are portable ISO C and single-threaded.

Each instance folder provides a Makefile. Check the README in each implementation strength level (i.e 128) folder for futher information 

Run `make` and `make run` inside an instance folder to generate its KAT_SIG file under the local output/ directory.
Run `make bench` to compile a fast test benchmark
Call ./bench_sig <iterations> to customize number of iterations